    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where only the strongest survive. This is an uncompromising side-scrolling street action game that combines stylish visuals with tight and hardcore gameplay. Choose one of two unique characters, each with their own fighting style. Use whatever comes to hand. There are no rules here, there are only you and crowds of enemies. Mistakes will not be forgiven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two playable characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wide arsenal of weapons: cold, throwing and firearms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Destructible objects and interaction with the environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized graphics </p>",
